or\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater, Uncertainty Cave</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"NPC\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">NPC</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mushroo\" title=\"Mushroo\">Mushroo</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Shop</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.4.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Music\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Music</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MkljsMZ26e0\">Kevin MacLeod - Townie Loop</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nFungi Finds is a shop found in <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave\" title=\"Uncertainty Cave\">Uncertainty</a>. The shopkeeper, <a href=\"/wiki/Mushroo\" title=\"Mushroo\">Spore Mushroo</a>, sells items such as <a href=\"/wiki/Dice\" title=\"Dice\">Dice</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Teacup\" title=\"Mysterious Teacup\">Mysterious Teacups</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Kallostide\" title=\"Kallostide\">Kallostide</a>. The shop can be found by exploding the breakable wall found near the possible pirate ship spawn further back into the Uncertainty Cave. Note that there is a wall blocking off access to this area, which will require being removed using explosives. (2 3x dynamite works, for example.)\n</p><p>Note: (No, this area wasn't removed in the map revamp. It was just moved and hidden, like other parts of the game.)\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/42/Fungi_Finds_Entrance.png/revision/latest?cb=20240905222105\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The outside of Fungi Finds\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/42/Fungi_Finds_Entrance.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240905222105\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"128\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Fungi Finds Entrance.png\" data-image-key=\"Fungi_Finds_Entrance.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Fungi_Finds_Entrance.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The outside of Fungi Finds</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p> When finding the entrance, find the entrance to the fusion coil cave and keep heading forward until you find a random piller\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Items\">Items</span></h2>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Dice\" title=\"Dice\">Dice</a></td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1f/Dice_Boxed.png/revision/latest?cb=20230716182543\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dice Boxed\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1f/Dice_Boxed.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20230716182543\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Dice Boxed.png\" data-image-key=\"Dice_Boxed.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$2,150\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Teacup\" title=\"Mysterious Teacup\">Mysterious Teacup</a></td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e0/Mysterious_Teacup_.png/revision/latest?cb=20230716182900\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Mysterious Teacup \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e0/Mysterious_Teacup_.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20230716182900\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Mysterious Teacup .png\" data-image-key=\"Mysterious_Teacup_.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$6,704\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Kallostide\" title=\"Kallostide\">Kallostide</a></td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a3/Kallostide.png/revision/latest?cb=20240306154329\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Kallostide\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Kallostide.png\" data-image-key=\"Kallostide.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/i